## Empty States

Every list, table, or data section must handle the "no data yet" case with a helpful empty state — not a blank space.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — nothing renders when list is empty
{items.map(item => <ItemCard key={item.id} {...item} />)}

// ✅ GOOD
{items.length === 0 ? (
  <div className="text-center py-8">
    <Package className="w-8 h-8 mx-auto mb-2 text-gray-400" />
    <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">No items yet</p>
  </div>
) : (
  items.map(item => <ItemCard key={item.id} {...item} />)
)}
```
